{
  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><strong>[Glint of Clouds] Featured Weapon Convene</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1787068800000/sj53struwv4fsm6zmd-1787122279095.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></strong>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">During the event, 5-Star Weapon: Glint of Clouds, 4-Star Weapons: Commando of Conviction, Fusion Accretion, and Lunar Cutter receive boosted drop rates!</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">✦Duration✦</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\">Version 3.6 update - 2026-09-10 09:59 (server time)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\">✦Eligibility✦</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"6\" data-line=\"true\">- Reach Union Level 5.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"7\" data-line=\"true\">- Or complete the combat trial in First Resonance.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"8\" data-line=\"true\">- Or access Main Quest Fast Track Event and proceed with the Main Quest until you reach a certain point.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"9\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"10\" data-line=\"true\">✦Convene Rules✦</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"11\" data-line=\"true\">- [Absolute Pulsation] is a Featured Weapon Convene event banner.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"12\" data-line=\"true\">- Use Forging Tide to convene. You are guaranteed at least one 4-Star or higher rarity Resonator or Weapon every 10 attempts.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"13\" data-line=\"true\">- The guarantee count is shared among all Featured Weapon Convene events and is carried over until a 5-Star Weapon is obtained.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"14\" data-line=\"true\">- The 5-Star Weapon you Convene is guaranteed to be Glint of Clouds.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"15\" data-line=\"true\">- Featured Weapon \"Glint of Clouds\" is exclusive to the Featured Weapon Convene and will not be available by other means once the event ends.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"16\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"17\" data-line=\"true\">※For more details, please refer to the in-game Convene page.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
